-- lib/elf.cub — a process as a standalone binary (#build, PLAN 4.4 item 5). Loaded after
-- lib/x86.cub and lib/world.cub.
--
-- #build s "file", s : Step W A (lib/world.cub: to-step of a process over the drivers' signature),
-- writes a static ELF64 executable with nothing behind it: the start code maps the arena and
-- calls the blob; the blob is lib/x86.cub's (stub, apply routine, definitions) with one more
-- routine, the driver loop, which is src/drivers.c's loop as machine code: read the step; done
-- ends the process with status 0; a command is performed by its system call, its response built
-- as the value the continuation expects, and the continuation applied to it (the apply routine)
-- for the next step. An overflow (checked Word arithmetic past 2^64, the arena or the stack
-- exhausted) ends the process with status 3: there is no net to compute the call instead.
-- Trusted with the encoder: the driver loop and the start code (they leave with the syscall
-- world's contracts, Phase 3, and the template lemmas, Phase 2).
--
-- The driver loop's lines (rax the step; [rbp-8] the apply routine's offset; a command's cell is
-- [index][fields], the commands of WCmd in their declared order):
--   loop: tag 0 (sdone) → return 0. Otherwise the command in rsi, the continuation pushed.
--   w-now (0, no fields): clock_gettime(REALTIME) → seconds·10⁹ + nanoseconds
--   w-write fd n b: write(fd, b's data, min n (b's length)) → the count, 0 when negative or empty
--   w-read fd n: a byte string of n zero bytes from the arena, read(fd, data, n) → the pair
--     (count, 0 when negative; the byte string)
--   w-sleep ns: nanosleep(ns / 10⁹, ns mod 10⁹) → unit
--   w-exit c: exit_group(c)
--   w-open n p flags mode: p's first min n (p's length) bytes copied to fresh arena memory (zero
--     after them, the arena is never reused), open(copy, flags, mode) → the descriptor sign-extended
--   w-close fd: close(fd) → the result sign-extended
--   w-load a: [a]; w-store a v: [a] := v → unit; w-cas a old new: lock cmpxchg → the value seen;
--   w-fence (10, no fields): mfence → unit
--   resp: the continuation and the response pushed, the apply routine called, back to loop
i-driver-loop = lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (xb4 #72 #139 #8 #72) (xb4 #133 #201 #15 #132)) (lapp (xb4 #201 #2 #0 #0) (lapp (xb4 #72 #139 #112 #8) (xb4 #255 #112 #16 #72)))) (lapp (lapp (xb4 #129 #254 #0 #16) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #115 #19) (xb4 #72 #133 #246 #15))) (lapp (xb4 #132 #145 #0 #0) (lapp (xb4 #0 #15 #174 #240) (xb4 #49 #192 #233 #145))))) (lapp (lapp (lapp (xb4 #2 #0 #0 #72) (xb4 #139 #14 #72 #131)) (lapp (xb4 #249 #1 #15 #132) (lapp (xb4 #167 #0 #0 #0) (xb4 #72 #131 #249 #2)))) (lapp (lapp (xb4 #15 #132 #215 #0) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #72 #131) (xb4 #249 #3 #15 #132))) (lapp (xb4 #46 #1 #0 #0) (lapp (xb4 #72 #131 #249 #4) (xb4 #15 #132 #77 #1)))))) (lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #72 #131) (xb4 #249 #5 #15 #132)) (lapp (xb4 #78 #1 #0 #0) (lapp (xb4 #72 #131 #249 #6) (xb4 #15 #132 #150 #1)))) (lapp (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #72 #131) (lapp (xb4 #249 #7 #15 #132) (xb4 #159 #1 #0 #0))) (lapp (xb4 #72 #131 #249 #8) (lapp (xb4 #15 #132 #161 #1) (xb4 #0 #0 #72 #131))))) (lapp (lapp (lapp (xb4 #249 #9 #15 #132) (lapp (xb4 #169 #1 #0 #0) (xb4 #72 #131 #249 #11))) (lapp (xb4 #15 #132 #178 #1) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #72 #131) (xb4 #249 #12 #15 #132)))) (lapp (lapp (xb4 #200 #1 #0 #0) (lapp (xb4 #72 #131 #249 #13) (xb4 #15 #132 #1 #2))) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #72 #131) (lapp (xb4 #249 #14 #15 #132) (xb4 #0 #2 #0 #0))))))) (lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (lapp (xb4 #15 #11 #72 #131) (xb4 #236 #16 #184 #228)) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #0 #49) (lapp (xb4 #255 #72 #137 #230) (xb4 #15 #5 #72 #139)))) (lapp (lapp (xb4 #4 #36 #72 #199) (lapp (xb4 #193 #0 #202 #154) (xb4 #59 #72 #15 #175))) (lapp (xb4 #193 #72 #3 #68) (lapp (xb4 #36 #8 #72 #131) (xb4 #196 #16 #233 #221))))) (lapp (lapp (lapp (xb4 #1 #0 #0 #72) (lapp (xb4 #139 #126 #8 #72) (xb4 #139 #86 #16 #72))) (lapp (xb4 #139 #118 #24 #72) (lapp (xb4 #59 #22 #118 #3) (xb4 #72 #139 #22 #72)))) (lapp (lapp (xb4 #131 #198 #8 #49) (lapp (xb4 #192 #72 #133 #210) (xb4 #15 #132 #186 #1))) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #184 #1) (lapp (xb4 #0 #0 #0 #15) (xb4 #5 #72 #133 #1